sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant PB as PromptBuilder
    participant FSL as FewShotSelector
    participant TP as TemplateProcessor
    participant GS as GuardrailSanitizer
    participant TB as TokenBudget

    Client->>PB: Intake Query (User Input)
    PB->>FSL: semantic few-shot lookup(query)
    FSL-->>PB: Returns similar examples

    PB->>TP: template assembly(query, examples)

    TP->>GS: injection sanitization(raw payload)
    GS-->>TP: Safe variables

    TP-->>PB: Assembled un-truncated prompt

    PB->>TB: token truncation(assembled prompt)
    TB-->>PB: Truncated prompt (fits budget)

    PB-->>Client: model payload output
